{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0330_pc_02",
      "hash": "09a33de112d0efab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "电脑屏幕上\\n显示出了传送机器！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_10",
      "hash": "f7d8f6e3f59b634d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎哟！赶紧着！\\n劳驾您了～"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0330_pc_01",
      "hash": "09a33ee112d0f15e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]启动了\\n传送机器的分离程序！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_01",
      "hash": "f7d571e3f5984b77",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正辉：诶哟～！\\n谢您谢您！救命恩人！\\c\\n……噢！兄弟您厉害！\\n您的包包里已经\\r\\n装好了[VAR COLOR(0006)]盒子[VAR COLOR(0000)]功能了嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_02",
      "hash": "f7d572e3f5984d2a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正辉：诶哟～！\\n谢您谢您！救命恩人！\\c\\n……噢！妹子您厉害！\\n您的包包里已经\\r\\n装好了[VAR COLOR(0006)]盒子[VAR COLOR(0000)]功能了嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_06",
      "hash": "f7d56ee3f598465e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宝可梦捉太多，\\n盒子里要是装满了，\\r\\n您[VAR COLOR(0006)]传送给大木博士[VAR COLOR(0000)]就成了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_07",
      "hash": "f7d56fe3f5984811",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0330_sys_03",
      "hash": "6149ed9ac41a89fe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_05",
      "hash": "f7d56de3f59844ab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……啊，对了！\\n为了感谢您刚才救了我，\\r\\n也算是个谢礼了……\\r\\n送您这个吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0330_sys_01",
      "hash": "6149eb9ac41a8698",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从正辉那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]船票[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_masaki_01_p06_r025_r0101",
      "hash": "4907e3945140cfdf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_03",
      "hash": "f7d573e3f5984edd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "现在圣特安努号\\n正停在枯叶港口。\\c\\n人家给了我这船票，\\n可我是真心对派对没兴趣……\\c\\n这里头应该是有２张票吧，\\n您再找个谁一起去玩儿呗！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_04",
      "hash": "f7d56ce3f59842f8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正辉：捉到的宝可梦数量太多，\\n盒子里要是装满了的话，\\r\\n汇总起来传送给大木博士就成！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0330_max",
      "hash": "66fb5334a3e316cd"
    }
  ]
}
